  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Township Economic Development Programme Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on the foundations of the NT&apos;s TED programme Phase 1, 2 and 3. The core objective of this project is to consolidate the achievements of the TED strategies and associated projects in 5 pilots, establish a direct alignment between the FCDO&apos;s investment  on urban economic development in South Africa and TED partners (including the NT CSP), deepening the impact of specific TED projects, and sharing crucial learning on institutionalising localised economic development planning. The proposed project will enable the TED project to extend the provision of technical support to five partnering metros for a period of 24 months, with this new project phase commencing in April 2023 and concluding in April 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
